      "id": "claim_09a18b92865e441d97ea313c84a70211",
      "statement": "Approval decisions are approve (current action only), approve_session (this and future matching actions for the bridge connection), and deny; approve_session is scoped to { origin, actionType } computed from the active tab URL, and the extension re-verifies the active origin/actionType before execution, returning approval_origin_changed if the origin changed.",
