      "id": "claim_a14c81f01ada46edb27fed710b56b7e6",
      "statement": "Approval session grants live in extension background memory only (approvalSessionGrants Set) and are cleared when the bridge disconnects or the extension reloads; they are never persisted to localStorage, extension storage, or IndexedDB.",
