      "id": "claim_0be518c546384353aac89ae298fb48c8",
      "statement": "The Chrome manifest requests activeTab, scripting, storage, tabs, and downloads plus broad host permissions (http://*/*, https://*/*); per ADR 0030 the broad host permission is granted at install time so there is no runtime permission request flow (hasRegularPageAccess always returns true), and permissions are kept minimal and documented per the AGENTS.md invariants.",
